WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.629
Membership tier is an ordered category but it can be
represented in more than one

00:00:04.642 --> 00:00:10.163
way An ordinal code preserves the rank from Bronze
through Platinum

00:00:11.919 --> 00:00:18.989
A one-hot representation avoids expressing the
category as a single numeric distance Neither

00:00:19.003 --> 00:00:24.678
changes the underlying business meaning The better
representation depends

00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:27.652
on how the analytical method will interpret the
values
